{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 17 — Pandas intro: Series, DataFrame, indexing, selection\n","Objectives:\n","- Create Series and DataFrames.\n","- Index/column selection, boolean masks, loc/iloc.\n","- Basic inspection and summary."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[],"source":["import pandas as pd\n","import seaborn as sns\n","df = sns.load_dataset('tips')\n","df.head(), df.info(), df.describe(include='all')\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[],"source":["# Selection\n","df['total_bill'].head()\n","df[['total_bill','tip']].head()\n","df.loc[df['day']=='Sun', ['total_bill','tip','size']].head()\n","df.iloc[:5, :3]\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Indexing\n","Set and reset index; sort_index."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[],"source":["df2 = df.set_index(['day','time']).sort_index()\n","df2.loc[('Sun','Dinner')].head()\n","df2.reset_index().head()\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Exercises\n","1) Select only Dinner rows and compute average tip.\n","2) Create a boolean column `is_big_party` for size >= 5.\n","3) Sort by tip percentage (tip/total_bill) descending."]}]}
